[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange-bd3-early 5.c3"]
[Name "4...Nf6 5.c3 e6"]

5... e6 { Solid, and the bishop on c8 stays shut in. }
6. Bf4 { White's bishop gets outside the pawn chain, and Black's cannot. }
6... Bd6
7. Bxd6 Qxd6
8. Nd2 { The same knight, then Ngf3 and castling. }
8... O-O
9. Ngf3 Nc6
10. O-O *
